CREATE TABLE "PlanPurchase" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL,"userId" TEXT NOT NULL,"planId" TEXT NOT NULL,"amountSnapshot" BIGINT NOT NULL,"currencySnapshot" TEXT NOT NULL,"status" "PurchaseStatus" NOT NULL DEFAULT 'PENDING_PAYMENT',"paymentReference" TEXT,"paidAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,CONSTRAINT "PlanPurchase_pkey" PRIMARY KEY ("id"),CONSTRAINT "PlanPurchase_userId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("userId") REFERENCES "User"("id"),CONSTRAINT "PlanPurchase_planId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("planId") REFERENCES "BenefitPlan"("id"));
CREATE TABLE "BenefitMembership" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL,"userId" TEXT NOT NULL,"planId" TEXT NOT NULL,"purchaseId" TEXT NOT NULL,"status" "BenefitMembershipStatus" NOT NULL DEFAULT 'PENDING',"startsAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"endsAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,CONSTRAINT "BenefitMembership_pkey" PRIMARY KEY ("id"),CONSTRAINT "BenefitMembership_userId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("userId") REFERENCES "User"("id"),CONSTRAINT "BenefitMembership_planId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("planId") REFERENCES "BenefitPlan"("id"),CONSTRAINT "BenefitMembership_purchaseId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("purchaseId") REFERENCES "PlanPurchase"("id"));
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "PlanPurchase_paymentReference_key" ON "PlanPurchase"("paymentReference");
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "BenefitMembership_purchaseId_key" ON "BenefitMembership"("purchaseId");
CREATE INDEX "PlanPurchase_userId_createdAt_idx" ON "PlanPurchase"("userId","createdAt");
CREATE INDEX "PlanPurchase_planId_status_idx" ON "PlanPurchase"("planId","status");
CREATE INDEX "BenefitMembership_userId_status_endsAt_idx" ON "BenefitMembership"("userId","status","endsAt");
